<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs Intl reports H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs Intl reports H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net						 54  vs	     128</p>
<p>    Operating					211  vs	     381</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 286  vs	     337</p>
<p>    Investments				    150  vs	     218</p>
<p>    Turnover				     4,513  vs	   4,637</p>
<p>NOTE - Chargeurs International was formed in June from the split of Chargeurs SA into two quoted companies, Pathe and Chargeurs International, with the first taking over media interests and the second taking over textiles and other businesses of the Chargeurs SA diversified conglomerate.</p>
<p>1995 comparatives are pro-forma.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
